# The package sources of luna osimage create, by the image's distribution and release.
# Key: <distribution>/<osrelease> or <distribution>/<osrelease>/<architecture>.
# Value: one to eight sources: an http or https mirror, a file:// tree, or an ISO on this
# controller. The entry with the architecture is taken before the one without.
# An image with no entry here is built from this controller's own repositories.
# This file is written once by the installer. Edit it on each controller; trixd reads it
# at every create, so no restart is needed.
#
# redhat/9.6:
#   - https://download.rockylinux.org/pub/rocky/9/
# redhat/9.6/arm64:
#   - /isos/Rocky-9.6-aarch64-dvd.iso
# ubuntu/24.04:
#   - http://mirror.example.org/ubuntu/
